sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Central<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over Product, CN: Assume the CN currently has 2 bonds stored.

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.RemoveBondWithAddress(<br>address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress)
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)

    Note over Product: NumberOfBondsChanged reports the current bond count after removal (N-1).
